 ('02-chamado','Um pedido ao longe',[(10,14,'???','Socorro! Tem alguém aí?')], 'Medium two-shot, same trail and daylight. Seconds0-2 Tyler and Saber walk into view left to right. At2s a distant young girl cries in Brazilian Portuguese, "Socorro! Tem alguém aí?" Tyler stops, turns his head toward screen right; Saber\'s ears prick and her stance becomes alert. Seconds4-8 Tyler gestures toward the sound and they move cautiously toward the clearing. One slow camera push, clear acting, no scene morph. Audio the distant girl line, leaves and small bell, no music.'),
 ('03-pedido','Lia pede ajuda',[(17,20,'Lia','Por favor, me ajudem!'),(20,23.6,'Lia','O Lacertubo não deixa ninguém passar pela ponte!')], 'Medium shot of Lia stepping from the right-side ferns onto the trail, Tyler and Saber visible at left listening. Seconds0-2 she takes two hurried steps and catches her breath. Seconds2-6 she points off-screen right toward the stream bridge, speaking frightened but clearly in Brazilian Portuguese: "Por favor, me ajudem! O Lacertubo não deixa ninguém passar pela ponte!" Seconds6-8 Tyler listens, Saber shifts protectively between them and the unseen threat. No running in place or teleporting. Audio Lia\'s one continuous line, breath, forest ambience.'),
 ('04-promessa','Tyler decide ajudar',[(25,28.5,'Tyler','Fique atrás de mim. Vamos abrir o caminho.'),(29.2,30.8,'Tyler','Pronta, Saber?')], 'Medium close three-quarter Tyler, Lia behind left, Saber close foreground right. Seconds0-3 Tyler calmly raises one gloved hand reassuringly toward Lia and says in Brazilian Portuguese, "Fique atrás de mim. Vamos abrir o caminho." Seconds3-6 he lifts a compact wooden kite-line spool; a thin burgundy string runs visibly from his hand to Saber\'s bamboo bridle. He asks, "Pronta, Saber?" Saber lowers her shoulders, ears forward, gives a short determined feline chirp. Seconds6-8 Tyler turns to lead toward the bridge. Wind rustles jacket tails. No magic identity reveal, no lab imagery, no music.'),
 ('05-lacertubo','O guardião da ponte',[(34.2,36.3,'Tyler','Então é você, Lacertubo...')], 'Wide low battle establishing shot in the SAME forest clearing: short wooden footbridge over a shallow stream in background right, mossy boulder left, a leaning tree frames the rear. Saber and Tyler stay SCREEN LEFT, Lacertubo SCREEN RIGHT facing left. Lia stays safely behind Tyler at far left. Seconds0-3 Lacertubo steps from the bridge approach, bamboo/paper joints flex with his low heavy stride. Seconds3-5 he plants four clawed feet and lifts his triangular dorsal sail, gives a rough papery lizard growl. Tyler quietly says in Brazilian Portuguese, "Então é você, Lacertubo..." Seconds5-8 Saber braces facing right, burgundy string connects to Tyler. Maintain clear axis and distance, no immediate attack. Stream, rustling paper, growl, no music.'),
 ('06-esquiva','Primeiro ataque',[(41,43,'Tyler','Saber, pela esquerda!')], 'Dynamic medium-wide shot, SAME bridge clearing and screen axis. Seconds0-2 Lacertubo on RIGHT lowers his head and charges LEFT with real four-legged steps, kicking ochre dust. Tyler at far LEFT shouts in Brazilian Portuguese, "Saber, pela esquerda!" Seconds2-5 Saber springs SIDEWAYS toward foreground, paws fold and extend in a readable evasive arc; Lacertubo rushes past her previous position and brakes on claws. Seconds5-8 Saber lands firmly on four dark paws at LEFT foreground, petals trail behind then settle, Lacertubo turns on RIGHT. Thin line stays attached with plausible slack, no line through neck. No injury, no blood. Paw impacts, paper rush and sliding gravel; no music.'),
 ('07-contra-ataque','Uma abertura',[(50.3,52.1,'Tyler','Agora! Corta o vento!')], 'Low lateral anime action shot, same clearing, Saber LEFT, Lacertubo RIGHT. Seconds0-2 Saber crouches and compresses hind legs, Tyler firmly controls the line from left background. Seconds2-5 Saber leaps forward RIGHT, her attached shoulder kite tilts, pink petal ribbon draws a short sweeping arc. Tyler shouts in Brazilian Portuguese, "Agora! Corta o vento!" Saber\'s forepaw and a controlled pink wind crescent strike Lacertubo\'s side with a brief white cel impact burst. Seconds5-8 Lacertubo staggers one pace but recovers, his dorsal sail flares, Saber lands at center-left ready again. Do not defeat him yet. No character morph or fusion, no glowing fur transformation. Papery impact, gust, claws scrape, no music.'),
 ('08-assinatura','Laço de confiança',[(57,59.3,'Tyler','Juntos, Saber. Laço de Cerejeira!')], 'Tense medium-close preparation shot, Tyler at LEFT and Saber near RIGHT foreground with Lacertubo blurred far right background, same sunny clearing. Seconds0-2 Tyler plants his feet, grips the wooden spool and draws the burgundy line taut with one deliberate arm motion, close acting on his determined eyes. Seconds2-5 he says in Brazilian Portuguese, "Juntos, Saber. Laço de Cerejeira!" A restrained pink light travels along the VISIBLE ATTACHED LINE to the bamboo shoulder kite. Seconds5-8 Saber crouches low, four paws steady, pink petals circle her attached kite, two saber fangs catch a clean highlight. Anticipation and gathering force, no strike yet. Paper twang, rising breeze, gentle bell, no music.'),
